# the front door: the forged contact sheet.
# a 200, knot a 301, on purpose — a rewrite serves the page while the
# address bar keeps saying only song.aprojectwithnopurpose.com, the exact
# words the contact card's homepage field says. the moment a path appears
# up there the forgery cracks. the ! forces it past any index.html.
/                 /unknown.html      200!

# the intro is knot the door any more, it is one room in: the call that
# nobody answers hands off to phone.html, and phone.html's ride home is
# what reaches intro from there. the old address is kept walkable.
/intro            /intro.html        200

# the tunnel page travels as index-doors.html (the artist's word) —
# every old spelling is FORCED onto the new name so no stale deploy,
# cache or bookmark can strand the egg room's crossing on a 404
/indexdoors.html  /index-doors.html  301!
/indexdoors       /index-doors.html  301!
/index-doors      /index-doors.html  200
